    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/dcb8347573048a534f0ac480e28d3fdb.avif?t=1752006071\" alt=\"Barfy&#039;s Adventure\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Beta Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barfy's Adventure is a fast-paced platformer about collecting gears, dashing through enemies, switching gravity, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: BA currently uses its own launcher for game updates. However, this may change in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/44ef7d15396f86f0d8b485814c273957.poster.avif?t=1752006071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/44ef7d15396f86f0d8b485814c273957.apng?t=1752006071\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Build Levels!\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own levels in the editor, and publish them online for others to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your level is high quality enough, it may get spotlighted by our team of moderators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/f28fcfcf640ddd4f5bfaa7d6f6ee6f36.avif?t=1752006071\" alt=\"A screenshot of the level editor.\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete spotlighted levels to rank higher on the leaderboard, and obtain bollars. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Log in to save ghost recordings of your completions, and race against other players' ghosts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dyes, hats, and other cosmetics from achievements, or by spending bollars at the Restaurant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/a1f49bd5620b050f4f201379082c908f.avif?t=1752006071\" alt=\"A screenshot of a ghost race.\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/dcb8347573048a534f0ac480e28d3fdb.avif?t=1752006071\" alt=\"Barfy&#039;s Adventure\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Beta Version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barfy's Adventure is a fast-paced platformer about collecting gears, dashing through enemies, switching gravity, and so much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: BA currently uses its own launcher for game updates. However, this may change in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/44ef7d15396f86f0d8b485814c273957.poster.avif?t=1752006071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/44ef7d15396f86f0d8b485814c273957.apng?t=1752006071\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Build Levels!\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own levels in the editor, and publish them online for others to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your level is high quality enough, it may get spotlighted by our team of moderators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/f28fcfcf640ddd4f5bfaa7d6f6ee6f36.avif?t=1752006071\" alt=\"A screenshot of the level editor.\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete spotlighted levels to rank higher on the leaderboard, and obtain bollars. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Log in to save ghost recordings of your completions, and race against other players' ghosts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dyes, hats, and other cosmetics from achievements, or by spending bollars at the Restaurant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850530/extras/a1f49bd5620b050f4f201379082c908f.avif?t=1752006071\" alt=\"A screenshot of a ghost race.\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
